Following questions to the delegations and to staff, and with Committeediscussions having concluded, Roadmap Motion EPPSC 2024 15-02 wasput before Committee and was ‘CARRIED’, as presented, with CouncillorM. Luloff recusing himself from the vote on line item 3.B.i. - Ottawa FireService Operating Resource Requirement - Communications (page 7 of theCommittee’s Full Budget Book) prior to the vote on that particular line item.
